---
description: Stage 1 devalidation — run CLEARFRAME + Market Reality on a captured idea to produce a 0–10 score and Go/No-Go. Bias to No; abort at < 4/10.
globs:
  - "ideas/**/00-idea-capture.md"
  - "ideas/**/01-devalidation-report.md"
alwaysApply: false
---

Follow `skills/clearframe-devalidation/SKILL.md` exactly. Read the idea's
`00-idea-capture.md`, run CLEARFRAME then the Market Reality Evaluator, and write
the Verdict + CLEARFRAME/Market Reality section of `01-devalidation-report.md`.
Bias to "No-Go". If the score is < 4/10, stop and have the idea marked `dropped`.
Do not run the trends check (that is `boring-and-trends-check`). Never advance the
human gate — it needs `GREENLIGHT NEXT STAGE`.
